1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,320
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,800
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,480
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,680
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,800
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,280
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,200
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,400
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,600
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,320
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:48,680
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,000
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,400
=Episode 20=

15
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,519
(Lingering Fragrance)
I've sent word to my son Lin Xuan.

16
00:01:14,079 --> 00:01:15,519
You're still in the mood for tea?

17
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,560
Once he arrives,

18
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:18,079
he'll make you kneel and beg for mercy.

19
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:19,799
Make me kneel and beg for mercy?

20
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,920
I hope he has what it takes.

21
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:22,719
You...

22
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,000
Who dares bully the Lin family?

23
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,400
(Virtue Shines Through)

24
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,440
(Auspicious Omens)

25
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:31,680
Xuan.

26
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,120
Xuan.

27
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,359
- Xuan.
- Xuan.

28
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,439
You're finally here.

29
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,760
That's him.

30
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:37,879
He hurt your father.

31
00:01:38,439 --> 00:01:38,800
He even threatened to throw us all out.

32
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,400
(Virtue Shines Through)
He even threatened to throw us all out.

33
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,158
(Virtue Shines Through)

34
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:42,920
(Virtue Shines Through)
Zhao Feiyang.

35
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,599
It's you.

36
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,200
You were expelled from the sect.

37
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,799
Instead of lying low and scraping by,

38
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,920
you came after my family.

39
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,000
You've got some nerve.

40
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:56,040
I've got some nerve?

41
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:02,120
When I was chief disciple,

42
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,079
you were merely

43
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:06,079
a lackey following me around.

44
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:07,920
Our families were old friends,

45
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:09,680
so I always looked out for you.

46
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,759
I never thought, Lin Xuan,

47
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:13,520
you'd turn out to be such an ingrate.

48
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,759
That was then.

49
00:02:15,159 --> 00:02:16,360
This is now.

50
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,280
Times have changed.

51
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:20,680
Don't lord your old status over me.

52
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,199
Now,

53
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:24,479
you're nothing but a stray dog now.

54
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:27,400
A stray...

55
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,039
Make your move.

56
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,960
I'll give you three moves.

57
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,719
Did I hear that right?

58
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,159
You'll give me three moves?

59
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:41,080
I'm in the Spirit Burst Realm.

60
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,719
I'm among the powerful cultivators
on Shenwu Continent now.

61
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:46,319
You restarted cultivation
barely a year ago,

62
00:02:46,759 --> 00:02:48,199
yet you'll give me three moves?

63
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,960
Aren't you afraid
people will laugh at you?

64
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,159
I gave you your chance.

65
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:53,919
You refused it.

66
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:55,879
Now I'll make my move.

67
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:59,240
Xuan, don't go easy on him.

68
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,439
Cripple him.

69
00:03:00,639 --> 00:03:01,240
- Yes.
- Or else,

70
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:03,080
our family will be disgraced.

71
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:04,840
Don't worry, Father.

72
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:07,360
I'll make him wish he were dead.

73
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,599
Wandering Dragon Sword Art, first form.

74
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:14,120
Dragon Tail Sweep.

75
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:19,719
How...

76
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,280
how is that possible?

77
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,439
Wandering Dragon Sword Art

78
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,960
can't even break your defense?

79
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:25,680
That's the gap between us.

80
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:26,879
Understand?

81
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,759
Wandering Dragon Sword Art, second form.

82
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:29,840
Dragon Turn.

83
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,280
Third form, Dragon's Roar.

84
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,280
Wandering Dragon Sword Art,
fourth form.

85
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,719
Devour Heaven.

86
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,240
Xuan.

87
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:01,639
Xuan.

88
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,919
I promised you three moves.

89
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,520
Why did you use four?

90
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,199
That's hardly honorable.

91
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,680
Zhao Feiyang.

92
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:10,680
No wonder you're so confident.

93
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,560
It's because of that robe.

94
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,479
I bet

95
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,560
it's a high-grade magic treasure.

96
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:16,839
Otherwise,

97
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,879
how could I not even
get through your defense?

98
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,480
You're right.

99
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,519
This robe

100
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,040
is a magic treasure.

101
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:28,680
But it isn't why

102
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,439
you couldn't break my defense.

103
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,920
Your Wandering Dragon Sword Art
is simply too weak.

104
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:35,279
It hasn't reached minor mastery.

105
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:36,040
Otherwise,

106
00:04:36,519 --> 00:04:38,199
you might have troubled me.

107
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:39,000
You...

108
00:04:39,639 --> 00:04:40,120
Enough.

109
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,040
I'm done wasting words.

110
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,439
Hand over all your resources,

111
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,519
then get out.

112
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:48,040
Call it compensation

113
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,079
for occupying our home for three years.

114
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:54,720
Zhao Feiyang.

115
00:04:55,319 --> 00:04:56,240
You want everything we own?

116
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,000
Dream on.

117
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,639
I'm the sect's chief disciple.

118
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:01,120
The sect values me greatly.

119
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:02,920
You dare treat me like this?

120
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,000
Aren't you afraid of angering
the Heavenly Sword Sect?

121
00:05:07,199 --> 00:05:08,439
Then there's nothing to discuss.

122
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:16,879
Xuan.

123
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:17,959
Xuan.

124
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:26,279
- Hand over the resources.
- (Xuan.)

125
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:27,600
Or...

126
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,879
Die.

127
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:32,720
Xuan.

128
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,639
Zhao Feiyang, don't be rash.

129
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:35,959
Right.

130
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,079
Our families go way back.

131
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:38,399
It needn't come to this.

132
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,199
There's no need for this.

133
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,439
Over such a small matter,

134
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,680
you won't even listen to reason.

135
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:44,160
You're no different from bandits
or evil cultivators.

136
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:45,079
Reason?

137
00:05:46,439 --> 00:05:48,199
In a world ruled by strength,

138
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,639
you ask me to be reasonable?

139
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,439
When the Zhao family fell,

140
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,480
those so-called righteous men

141
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,720
and our closest friends

142
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,639
all came for their share.

143
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,800
They picked us clean.

144
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,399
Years of hardship

145
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:02,399
taught me only one truth.

146
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:03,759
Fairness

147
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:07,439
must be upheld by your own hands.

148
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,560
(You have extraordinary talent.)

149
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:12,759
(You must seize every opportunity)

150
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,079
(to make yourself stronger)

151
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:16,079
(and put yourself beyond defeat!)

152
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,040
(I give you four more words.)

153
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:22,560
(By any means necessary!)

154
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:25,839
Good and evil mean nothing.

155
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:29,279
Every man must fend for himself.

156
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,000
I'll count to three.

157
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,600
Three.

158
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,079
Two.

159
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,360
One.

160
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:50,040
Wait.

161
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:54,720
Wait.

162
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,480
Elder Murong, you're here.

163
00:06:58,759 --> 00:07:00,199
Zhao Feiyang, stop at once.

164
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:06,360
Xuan.

165
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:07,879
Xuan.

166
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,560
Master.

167
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,959
Zhao Feiyang attacked my family

168
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,879
and wants my family's
cultivation resources.

169
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,279
He's no different
from an evil cultivator.

170
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,439
The Heavenly Sword Sect

171
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,240
upholds justice and slays demons.

172
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:25,439
Please kill him, Master.

173
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:27,920
Master?

174
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:32,040
Elder Murong, he's your disciple?

175
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,199
Of course.

176
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:36,800
I'm now the sect's chief disciple

177
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:39,199
and Elder Murong's first
closed-door disciple.

178
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,879
Zhao Feiyang, you crossed the wrong man.

179
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,560
Elder Murong.

180
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:47,319
Your judgment isn't great.

181
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,000
You...

182
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:50,040
Zhao Feiyang.

183
00:07:50,439 --> 00:07:51,920
You were once our disciple.

184
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,560
Even after your expulsion,

185
00:07:53,959 --> 00:07:55,360
you should still act honorably.

186
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,800
How could you do this?

187
00:07:57,319 --> 00:07:58,199
Leave now.

188
00:07:58,519 --> 00:07:59,680
I'll spare you this once.

189
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:02,079
Elder Murong,
so you'll protect your disciple?

190
00:08:03,279 --> 00:08:05,600
Lin Xuan is our chief disciple.

191
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,079
I won't let you run wild.

192
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:07,959
I advise you

193
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:10,160
not to make people lose faith in you.

194
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,000
Lose faith in me?

195
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:17,000
When I was the sect's chief disciple,

196
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:19,439
my family was destroyed.

197
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,959
No one in the sect helped us.

198
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,000
I'm the one who lost faith in the sect.

199
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,519
Elder Murong.

200
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,759
You once showed me some kindness.

201
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,320
So today,

202
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,279
stay out of this.

203
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:41,120
Or I won't hold back for your sake.

204
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:44,240
You arrogant fool.

205
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:46,320
Master.

206
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,480
You see that?

207
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,320
He's beyond redemption.

208
00:08:49,679 --> 00:08:51,639
Please subdue him at once.

209
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,720
But be careful.

210
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,840
That robe he's wearing

211
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,240
is a high-grade magic treasure.

212
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:58,919
Its defense is formidable.

213
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:00,960
Zhao Feiyang.

214
00:09:01,759 --> 00:09:02,440
What will it take

215
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,480
to settle this matter?

216
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,919
Hand over all their resources.

217
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:18,120
Then move out.

218
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:20,320
Master.

219
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:20,840
But...

220
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,120
When the Zhao family fell,

221
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:25,720
your family took their share too.

222
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,320
Today,

223
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,320
I cannot favor you too much.

224
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:30,799
Therefore,

225
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,279
do as he says.

226
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,879
What?

227
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:37,759
Master.

228
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,879
My family worked for years
to build all this.

229
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,039
How can we just hand it over?

230
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:42,360
But back then,

231
00:09:42,879 --> 00:09:44,799
you fought for the Zhao family's
resources too.

232
00:09:45,159 --> 00:09:47,399
You even seized their estate.

233
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,399
That is the truth.

234
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:52,080
Consider this fair repayment.

235
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,080
But...

236
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,080
Do it.

237
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,440
Yes, Master.

238
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:23,279
Zhao Feiyang, remember this.

239
00:10:23,679 --> 00:10:25,159
I'm yielding for Master's sake.

240
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,080
Once my Wandering Dragon Sword Art
reaches full mastery,

241
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:30,200
I'll avenge today's humiliation.

242
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,120
Enough talk.

243
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:31,879
Get lost.

244
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:32,720
You...

245
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,080
Zhao Feiyang.

246
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,639
You should watch yourself.

247
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:38,840
You should hide your strength
and bide your time.

248
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,279
Acting recklessly

249
00:10:40,639 --> 00:10:42,000
will only bring you trouble.

250
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:50,159
The Lin family's storage rings

251
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,720
hold over 200,000 spirit crystals.

252
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:56,000
I'm at Stage 9 of the
Minor Perfection Realm.

253
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:58,200
Once I absorb them all,

254
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,759
along with the qi in my qi sea,

255
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,360
I'll break through to the
Greater Perfection Realm.

256
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,320
I just need the right opportunity.

257
00:11:09,639 --> 00:11:11,840
Time to challenge an expert.

258
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,680
(Auspicious Omens)

259
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,200
(Virtue Shines Through)

260
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,000
Father.

261
00:11:36,679 --> 00:11:37,240
Mother.

262
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:39,960
Today,

263
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,159
I reclaimed our home.

264
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,720
Our family's revival

265
00:11:46,399 --> 00:11:47,600
will soon be at hand.

266
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,960
My girl, how did it go?

267
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:16,919
Father.

268
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:19,399
I've fully grasped the sword intent
of the Three Sword Immortals.

269
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:22,399
I've reached Stage 1 of the
Minor Perfection Realm.

270
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:23,519
Excellent.

271
00:12:24,039 --> 00:12:25,639
You haven't disappointed me.

272
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,519
Without you backing me with
the sect's full resources,

273
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:30,039
I could never have come this far.

274
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,159
No need for thanks between us.

275
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:35,240
A new spirit vein has appeared
in the Southern Domain.

276
00:12:35,559 --> 00:12:37,360
The Martial Arts Tournament
for sect disciples

277
00:12:37,679 --> 00:12:39,039
will decide who claims the spirit vein.

278
00:12:39,559 --> 00:12:41,720
Cultivation resources
on Shenwu Continent

279
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:42,919
are now extremely scarce.

280
00:12:43,559 --> 00:12:44,240
This time,

281
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:46,639
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
our sect must

282
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,639
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
win it.

283
00:12:50,159 --> 00:12:51,399
I won't disappoint you, Father.

284
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:55,400
(Martial Arts Tournament,
One Month Later)

285
00:12:59,279 --> 00:12:59,879
Senior Brother Lin.

286
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:00,879
What did you say?

287
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,799
Zhao Feiyang stole

288
00:13:02,919 --> 00:13:03,679
your family's cultivation resources?

289
00:13:04,759 --> 00:13:06,080
It was all because of Elder Murong.

290
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:07,080
Still,

291
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,320
this past month,

292
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:10,559
my Wandering Dragon Sword Art
has reached minor mastery.

293
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,039
Sooner or later, I'll settle the score.

294
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:13,799
That bastard

295
00:13:14,519 --> 00:13:15,200
deserves to die.

296
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:16,600
Recently,

297
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:18,919
a new spirit vein appeared
in the Southern Domain.

298
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:21,600
It has been over a century

299
00:13:21,799 --> 00:13:23,120
since the last one emerged.

300
00:13:23,399 --> 00:13:25,480
Spiritual energy on Shenwu Continent

301
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,840
is growing ever thinner.

302
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,639
No one knows

303
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:30,240
when another vein will appear.

304
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,519
The Three Great Sects

305
00:13:31,799 --> 00:13:34,159
will hold a Martial Arts Tournament
today

306
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,600
to decide who claims the spirit vein.

307
00:13:35,879 --> 00:13:37,600
Sect Master Qin, Sect Master Liang.

308
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,000
Any objections?

309
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:40,679
(Liang Long, Sect Master of Tianwu Sect)
Agreed.

310
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:41,759
(Qin Yan, Sect Master of Qingyun Sect)
Friendly bout.

311
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,159
Stop once victory is clear.

312
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:44,039
Good.

313
00:13:44,399 --> 00:13:47,360
The winner receives
the formation jade slip

314
00:13:47,879 --> 00:13:49,480
and becomes master of the spirit vein.

315
00:14:10,919 --> 00:14:12,159
Tianwu Sect and Qingyun Sect

316
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,480
may soon form a marriage alliance.

317
00:14:13,679 --> 00:14:16,440
Those two will join forces
against Cuihua.

318
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,200
This...

319
00:14:17,399 --> 00:14:17,919
Don't worry.

320
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:20,000
Cuihua has reached
the Minor Perfection Realm.

321
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,799
She'll remain undefeated.

322
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,120
The Minor Perfection Realm?

323
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:24,879
Really?

324
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,879
The young sect master has reached
the Minor Perfection Realm?

325
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:28,720
This...

326
00:14:28,759 --> 00:14:29,919
That's incredible.

327
00:14:31,519 --> 00:14:33,799
Heaven favors our sect.

328
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:44,960
A fight for the spirit vein?

329
00:14:45,559 --> 00:14:46,720
Count me in.

330
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:54,040
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

331
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:57,040
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

332
00:14:57,280 --> 00:15:00,680
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

333
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:04,600
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

334
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:08,880
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

335
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,960
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

336
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:15,480
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

337
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:19,640
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

338
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:23,640
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

339
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:27,120
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

340
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:30,360
♪With this flesh and soul♪

341
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:33,720
♪I shall forge a new age♪

342
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:37,000
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

343
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:40,440
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

344
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:43,000
♪At cultivation's peak♪

345
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,720
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

346
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:50,120
♪The sun and moon turn♪

347
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:53,520
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

348
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:59,000
♪I am the undying flame♪

349
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:05,440
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

350
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,760
♪At last I see, immortality♪

351
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:13,600
♪Lives in your smiles♪
